// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// TEZZ-OS — Interactive CLI Shell (shell/shell.tn)
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
//
//  Full-featured CLI shell for TEZZ-OS:
//   - Input line editor: left/right arrows, Home/End, Insert
//   - Command history (50 entries, up/down arrows)
//   - Tab completion for built-in commands
//   - Ctrl+C (cancel line), Ctrl+L (clear), Ctrl+D (shutdown)
//   - Mouse: click to position cursor in the input line
//   - Mouse scroll wheel: scroll history output
//   - Built-in commands:
//       help     — list commands
//       clear    — clear screen
//       echo     — print arguments
//       version  — OS version info
//       mem      — memory statistics
//       uptime   — system uptime
//       reboot   — reboot system
//       shutdown — power off system
//       proc     — list processes (stub)
//       cpuid    — CPU vendor string
//       color    — change console color scheme
//       history  — show command history
//       neofetch — system info display (ASCII art style)
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

